  "short_description": "在這款最多支持 6 人在線合作的恐怖遊戲中，直播自己在廢棄鐵路上的驚悚之旅。通過拍攝詭異怪物、表演危險特技以及惡搞好友來活躍直播氣氛。使用彈幕打賞購買燃料和裝備。你們能否活著離開恐怖谷？",
  "short_description_en": "An online co-op horror game where up to 6 players livestream their trip down an abandoned rail road. Keep your audience entertained by filming creatures, doing dangerous stunts, and pranking your friends. Use chatter donations to buy fuel and gear. Can you make it through the Uncanny Valley alive?",
